### ===================================
### UPMS (User Permission Management) API Tests
### ===================================

### ----- User Management -----
### Base Path: /api/upms/user

### Get Current User Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upms/user/current
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get Current User Permissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upms/user/current/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get Current User Roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upms/user/current/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get User by ID (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upms/user/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get User by Username (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upms/user/username/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get All Users (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upms/user?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Create New User (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upms/user
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "1234567890"
}

###

### Update User (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/upms/user/2
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "updated@example.com",
  "phone": "0987654321"
}

###

### Lock User Account (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upms/user/2/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Unlock User Account (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upms/user/2/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Change Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upms/user/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "oldpass123",
  "newPassword": "newpass123"
}

###

### ----- Department Management -----
### Base Path: /api/sys/dept

### Get Departments (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/dept/page?page=0&size=20

###

### Get Department by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/dept/1

###

### Get Departments by Parent ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/dept/parent/0

###

### Get Department Tree
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/dept/tree

###

### Create Department (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/dept
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deptName": "New Department",
  "parentId": 0,
  "sort": 1
}

###

### Update Department (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/dept/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deptName": "Updated Department",
  "sort": 2
}

###

### ----- Menu Management -----
### Base Path: /api/sys/menu

### Get Menus (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/menu/page?page=0&size=20

###

### Get Menu by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/menu/1

###

### Get Menus by Parent ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/menu/parent/0

###

### Get Menus by Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/menu/type/0

###

### ----- Role Management -----
### Base Path: /api/sys/role

### Get Roles (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/role/page?page=0&size=20

###

### Get Role by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/role/1

###

### Get Role by Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sys/role/code/ROLE_ADMIN
